3a. Amateur Radio Country Files (cty.dat) by Jim Reisert AD1C, https://www.country-files.com/
   Callsign prefixes, exact callsigns, country centres, continents and CQ / ITU zones, reduced to app/core/src/dxcc_table.inc and dxcc_exact.inc by tools/gen_dxcc.py
   (cty.dat itself is not included; generated from the copy of 2026-11-22). Used to reject a weak decode whose locator is impossible for its callsign's country, for the
   PSK Reporter tab's country column, and for the decoder's "new DXCC / continent / zone" tags. The site states no licence terms; the files are published for use in logging and decoding software
   (WSJT-X is among the programs it lists). If you redistribute this project, check the current terms there.

